{"overview":"گون فریکس می‌فهمد که پدری که همیشه به او گفته شده بود مرده، در واقع تمام مدت زنده بوده است. گینگ یک شکارچی مشهور است: فردی که خود را به‌عنوان یکی از برترین انسان‌ها ثابت کرده است. گون مصمم می‌شود که در مسیر پدرش قدم بردارد و آزمون سخت شکارچی را پشت سر بگذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Gon Freecss discovers that the father he had always been told was dead was actually alive the whole time. Ging is a famous Hunter: an individual who has proven themself an elite member of humanity. Gon becomes determined to follow in his father's footsteps, pass the rigorous Hunter Examination.","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":30,"y":2002,"poster":"/d6u7X0qmUrKOPpWqHgCRb1ZNfCi.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":62,"y":1999,"poster":"/4XvlGTXxHVaiYVuVzxvjYFNFNa1.jpg"}],"episodes":62,"crew":["古橋一浩"],"crew_en":["Kazuhiro Furuhashi"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"竹内順子","role":"Gon Freecss (voice)","photo":"/zNjrblq3xS1idpCsmSl5P5eTon7.jpg","en":"Junko Takeuchi"},{"name":"三橋加奈子","role":"Killua Zoldyck (voice)","photo":"/47itMqJIuXsHnK6FVBl3OoucggL.jpg","en":"Kanako Mitsuhashi"},{"name":"甲斐田ゆき","role":"Kurapika (voice)","photo":"/ha1k44zoFz1Vlf7LIQBcWYMuCGI.jpg","en":"Yuki Kaida"},{"name":"郷田ほづみ","role":"Leorio Paradinight (voice)","photo":"/tEJYYjEPiKqQIapgRmLJ66EYOte.jpg","en":"Hozumi Goda"},{"name":"高橋広樹","role":"Hisoka Morow (voice)","photo":"/lFwGUkR5Lj09FVz7s0xwFgQgeRi.jpg","en":"Hiroki Takahashi"},{"name":"大田詩織","role":"Baise (voice)","photo":"","en":"Shiori Ohta"},{"name":"杉野博臣","role":"Bendot (voice)","photo":"/4YPg9epkqyihm7VV2RVCJYnkxY1.jpg","en":"Tanuki Sugino"},{"name":"永野善一","role":"Chrollo Lucilfer (voice)","photo":"/i9kYw2bjK26zzWcWvZeoruEhohq.jpg","en":"Yoshikazu Nagano"},{"name":"高乃麗","role":"Illumi Zoldyck (voice)","photo":"/tzyRBSSYVy8hVBXBksDgBu5XQB9.jpg","en":"Urara Takano"},{"name":"日比野朱里","role":"Feitan (voice)","photo":"/1uU95ziw8A4WY6obbyARvuH0QuZ.jpg","en":"Akari Hibino"},{"name":"岸祐二","role"